      "displayAnswer": "以下采用保留的 2010 年四位数值表；表值均为近似值。各小问按题面顺序列出。\n\na) $10^{0.18}\\approx1.514$；$10^{0.34}\\approx2.188$；$10^{0.07}\\approx1.175$；$10^{0.94}\\approx8.710$；$10^{0.62}\\approx4.169$；$10^{0.41}\\approx2.570$。\n\nb) $10^{0.8}\\approx6.310$；$10^{0.4}\\approx2.512$；$10^{0.04}\\approx1.096$；$10^{0.1}\\approx1.259$；$10^{0.01}\\approx1.023$；$10^{0.09}\\approx1.230$。\n\nc) $10^{0.264}\\approx1.837$；$10^{0.356}\\approx2.270$；$10^{0.581}\\approx3.811$；$10^{0.299}\\approx1.991$；$10^{0.736}\\approx5.445$；$10^{0.154}\\approx1.426$。\n\nd) $10^{0.216}\\approx1.644$；$10^{0.081}\\approx1.205$；$10^{0.810}\\approx6.457$；$10^{0.001}\\approx1.002$；$10^{0.305}\\approx2.018$；$10^{0.909}\\approx8.110$。\n\ne) $10^{0.3845}\\approx2.424$；$10^{0.1761}\\approx1.500$；$10^{0.9111}\\approx8.149$；$10^{0.8716}\\approx7.440$；$10^{0.5432}\\approx3.493$。\n\nf) $10^{0.0061}\\approx1.014$；$10^{0.0745}\\approx1.187$；$10^{0.6057}\\approx4.033$；$10^{0.1011}\\approx1.262$；$10^{0.2706}\\approx1.865$。\n\n例如 e4：在 $0.87$ 行的主列 $1$ 读得 $7430$，在同一行修正列 $6$ 读得 $10$；相加得 $7440$，定位小数点后为 $7.440$。",
