      "displayAnswer": "采用保留的 2010 年四位数值表，先查得 $10^{0.546}\\approx3.516$、$10^{0.028}\\approx1.067$。\n\na) $10^{0.546}\\approx3.516$；$10^{1.546}=10\\cdot10^{0.546}\\approx35.16$；$10^{-1.454}=10^{-2}\\cdot10^{0.546}\\approx0.03516$。\n\nb) $10^{0.028}\\approx1.067$；$10^{2.028}=10^2\\cdot10^{0.028}\\approx106.7$；$10^{-0.972}=10^{-1}\\cdot10^{0.028}\\approx0.1067$。\n\n负指数分解为 $-1.454=-2+0.546$、$-0.972=-1+0.028$。",
