      "exercise": "678",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "采用保留的 2010 年四位数值表，先列出全部 25 个点。除整数指数的值外，表内 $y$ 均为查表近似值。\n\n| $x$ | $y=10^x$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $-1.2$ | $0.06310$ |\n| $-1.1$ | $0.07943$ |\n| $-1.0$ | $0.1$ |\n| $-0.9$ | $0.1259$ |\n| $-0.8$ | $0.1585$ |\n| $-0.7$ | $0.1995$ |\n| $-0.6$ | $0.2512$ |\n| $-0.5$ | $0.3162$ |\n| $-0.4$ | $0.3981$ |\n| $-0.3$ | $0.5012$ |\n| $-0.2$ | $0.6310$ |\n| $-0.1$ | $0.7943$ |\n| $0.0$ | $1$ |\n| $0.1$ | $1.259$ |\n| $0.2$ | $1.585$ |\n| $0.3$ | $1.995$ |\n| $0.4$ | $2.512$ |\n| $0.5$ | $3.162$ |\n| $0.6$ | $3.981$ |\n| $0.7$ | $5.012$ |\n| $0.8$ | $6.310$ |\n| $0.9$ | $7.943$ |\n| $1.0$ | $10$ |\n| $1.1$ | $12.59$ |\n| $1.2$ | $15.85$ |\n\n作图方法：\n\n1. 在方格纸上画互相垂直的坐标轴，两轴均取 $1\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ 为一个单位。纵轴至少标至 $16$，因此原点上方要留出至少 $16\\,\\mathrm{cm}$；横轴标出 $-1.2$ 至 $1.2$。\n2. 横坐标每增加 $0.1$，纸上向右移动 $1\\,\\mathrm{mm}$。逐行按 $(x,y)$ 描出全部 25 个点：从原点水平移动 $x\\,\\mathrm{cm}$，再向上移动 $y\\,\\mathrm{cm}$。\n3. 核对三个准确点 $(-1,0.1)$、$(0,1)$、$(1,10)$，以及近似端点 $(-1.2,0.06310)$、$(1.2,15.85)$。\n4. 用平滑、严格递增且向上凸的曲线连接这些点，只画 $-1.2\\le x\\le1.2$ 的部分。曲线始终在横轴上方，不用折线替代，也不改变题目规定的单位长。\n\n小的纵坐标在纸上不足 $1\\,\\mathrm{mm}$，描点只能达到纸笔允许的精度；这不省略数值表中的任何点。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "AUTHOR_ONLY candidate not independently reviewed/prepared/finalized/ready. Complete drawing task: 25 table ordinates plus the requested actual curve and both axes at 1 cm/unit. Ungraded because a reliable deterministic judge for the submitted drawing is unavailable; not because values are missing. Integer powers at x=-1,0,1 are exact. Remaining points are derived from actual XIV cells and integer scaling. Durable table source: ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/sources/references/bradis-2010-four-figure-tables.pdf; SHA-256 249b865dc7ae985ecfa6604531efb5e8b7896c481db1a5e2f4170940f4033656. Version 2010, 13th stereotype edition; equivalence to textbook-cited 1978 UNVERIFIED."
