    {
      "exercise": "679",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "以下是采用保留的 2010 年平方根表，再查 $10^x$ 表的一组完整近似结果。\n\na) 平方根表给出 $\\sqrt3\\approx1.732$。查 $0.73$ 行、主列 $2$ 得 $5395$，所以 $10^{\\sqrt3}\\approx10^{1.732}\\approx53.95$。\n\nb) 平方根表给出 $\\sqrt2\\approx1.414$。因为 $-1.414=-2+0.586$，查 $0.58$ 行、主列 $6$ 得 $3855$，所以 $10^{-\\sqrt2}\\approx10^{-1.414}\\approx0.03855$。\n\nc) 平方根表给出 $\\sqrt{10}\\approx3.162$。查 $0.16$ 行、主列 $2$ 得 $1452$，所以 $10^{\\sqrt{10}}\\approx10^{3.162}\\approx1452$。\n\nd) 由 $\\sqrt{0.1}=\\sqrt{10}/10\\approx0.3162$，查 $0.31$ 行、主列 $6$ 得 $2070$，再加同一行修正列 $2$ 的修正值 $1$，得到 $2071$，所以 $10^{\\sqrt{0.1}}\\approx10^{0.3162}\\approx2.071$。\n\n这些末位来自上述查表过程。平方根先被近似，再作为指数使用，误差会继续传播；不能把最终写出的四位数字都视为准确数字。题目未规定最终有效数字数，合理减少末位精度的写法也可成立。",
      "parts": [],
      "notes": "AUTHOR_ONLY frozen candidate, not independently reviewed/prepared/finalized/ready. All four standard answers are derived by an explicit table-first route, not direct theoretical powers. IV root-2 and root-10 are unchanged previously reviewed source-only cells; root-3 was freshly read on PDF36/printed35, and sqrt(0.1)=sqrt(10)/10 uses exact radical scaling. Direct IV main cells have 0.001 root units, so their rounding uncertainty is at most 0.0005; the scaled root 0.3162 has uncertainty at most 0.00005. For y=10^x, relative error from a small exponent error is approximately ln(10) times that error, in addition to XIV tabulation/interpolation error. Ungraded because the prompt leaves intermediate/final precision open and several defensible rounded results cannot be reliably judged with a single numeric expected; no invented tolerance/checker or direct-power expected is added. Durable source: ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/sources/references/bradis-2010-four-figure-tables.pdf; SHA-256 249b865dc7ae985ecfa6604531efb5e8b7896c481db1a5e2f4170940f4033656. 2010, 13th stereotype edition, Drofa, Moscow; 1978 equivalence UNVERIFIED."
